{"3352140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Satellite Odyssey: Jupiter", "steam_appid": 3352140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/e2353e72d80050bba27e74da834cd58e.poster.avif?t=1780217584\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/e2353e72d80050bba27e74da834cd58e.webm?t=1780217584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/e2353e72d80050bba27e74da834cd58e.mp4?t=1780217584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>What was meant to be a glamorous grand opening became a nightmare.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The service robots have turned violent. Mutants rampage through the halls, while the corpses of the Solar System’s elite are now strewn around the luxurious halls of the space station on one of Jupiter’s moons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">May wakes up in the midst of this disaster, having no recollection of what has happened or… who she is. But one thing is clear— she must survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/48486d812cc19d13aa068d6ffa221a6c.poster.avif?t=1780217584\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/48486d812cc19d13aa068d6ffa221a6c.webm?t=1780217584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extras/48486d812cc19d13aa068d6ffa221a6c.mp4?t=1780217584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fight or sneak past your enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight against an array of varied enemies, from mutated cockroaches hungering for your flesh to seductive androids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pick your battles carefully: sometimes avoiding a fight is the best way to conserve resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Manage your arsenal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Search the station for weapons, tools, and experimental equipment. Upgrade and customize your arsenal to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But remember: May isn’t a monster hunter. She’ll need time to get stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Collect and manage resources</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your inventory is limited — dresses don’t come with many pockets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Careful planning and smart decision-making are essential if you want to stay alive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Solve puzzles and use the station to your advantage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Naturally, a luxury space station built for the ultra-rich is filled with doors unlocked by strange keys and hidden levers. Along the way, you’ll acquire a multifunctional device capable of controlling machinery, opening secret passages, and turning the environment into a deadly weapon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use your wits where bullets fail.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>INVESTIGATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Examine the aftermath</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Search crime scenes for clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every piece of evidence may reveal what truly happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Piece together the truth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Using event cards you can reconstruct what happened, connect the dots, and form your own conclusions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Unravel a conspiracy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Immerse yourself in a world of political intrigue, broken hearts, and corporate warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find out who doomed the station, and why. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This station is far more than steel corridors and maintenance tunnels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From utility corridors to eerie abandoned lower levels with concert halls, casino, and luxury suites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And behind every door may be another secret waiting to emerge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352140/extr