=\"text-align: center\">Naturally, a luxury space station built for the ultra-rich is filled with doors unlocked by strange keys and hidden levers. Along the way, you’ll acquire a multifunctional device capable of controlling machinery, opening secret passages, and turning the environment into a deadly weapon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use your wits where bullets fail.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>INVESTIGATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Examine the aftermath</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Search crime scenes for clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every piece of evidence may reveal what truly happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Piece together the truth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Using event cards you can reconstruct what happened, connect the dots, and form your own conclusions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Unravel a conspiracy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Immerse yourself in a world of political intrigue, broken hearts, and corporate warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find out who doomed the station, and why. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This station is far more than steel corridors and maintenance tunnels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From utility corridors to eerie abandoned lower levels with concert halls, casino, and luxury suites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And behind every door may 